<title>UK: GOLF-BRITISH PGA CHAMPIONSHIP FINAL ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-BRITISH PGA CHAMPIONSHIP FINAL ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>WENTWORTH, England 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading final round</p>
<p>scores and totals in the British PGA golf championship on Monday</p>
<p>(Britain unless stated):</p>
<p>275 Ian Woosnam 67 68 70 70</p>
<p>277 Nick Faldo 70 67 70 70, Darren Clarke 66 74 66 71,</p>
<p>Ernie Els (South Africa) 69 71 67 70</p>
<p>278 Colin Montgomerie 69 69 76 64</p>
